  "question": {
    "text": "The ratio of number of water molecules in Mohr&#39;s salt and potash alum is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math> (Integer answer)",
